#floor2_preThroneRoom2_trophy1
  action,this
@this
  +setConversation(Ada)
  Narrator: "<color=LIGHTGREY />The trophy's plaque says:\n</> A commemoration for placing first in the inaugural <color=LIGHTBLUE />Regem Ludos Skyborne! Tournament</>."
  +endConversation()

#floor2_preThroneRoom2_trophy2
  action,this
@this
  +setConversation(Ada)
  Narrator: "<color=LIGHTGREY />The trophy's plaque says:\n</> The holder of this trophy is currently undefeated in head-to-head <color=LIGHTBLUE />Dasher Racing</> when confronted by a challenger."
  Narrator: "Footnote: the trophy-holder must have at least 10 matches played, and can retire at any time."
  +endConversation()

#floor2_preThroneRoom2_trophy3
  action,this
@this
  +setConversation(Ada)
  Narrator: "<color=LIGHTGREY />The trophy's plaque says:\n</> This trophy was given to the one who consumed the most hot-dogs in a single sitting at the <color=LIGHTRED /> Regem Ludos Cafeteria Eat Off</>."
  Narrator: "The entrants are engraved on the side of it.  There appear to only be four of them.  And it looks like one was disqualified."
  +endConversation()

#floor2_preThroneRoom2_trophy4
  action,this
@this
  +setConversation(Ada)
  Narrator: "<color=LIGHTGREY />The trophy's plaque says:\n</> This trophy is for being <color=LIGHTBLUE />most-likely to win a raffle</>."
  Narrator: "It seems the winner was drawn from a pot of entries."
  +endConversation()

#floor2_preThroneRoom2_trophy5
  action,this
@this
  +setConversation(Ada)
  Narrator: "<color=LIGHTGREY />The trophy's plaque says:\n</> This trophy is given to one who has won a game of <color=LIGHTBLUE>Solitaire</>."
  Narrator: "That's it.  That's all it says."
  +setFacing(Ada, down)
  +:flat(Ada)
  Ada: "Who hands out a trophy like <italic>that</>?"
  +endConversation()

#floor2_preThroneRoom2_trophy6
  action,this
@this
  +setConversation(Ada)
  Narrator: "<color=LIGHTGREY />The trophy's plaque says:\n</> This trophy is given to the best employee at <color=LIGHTRED />Deliver's Pizza</>, a nearby pizza joint."
  +:question(Ada)
  Ada: "There is a note pinned here."
  +:shakeZ(Ada)
  Narrator: "'Yo, CA, somebody came by to pick up your old trophy.'"
  Narrator: "'Apparantly they got a new employee and he's, like, breaking all your records or something.'"
  Narrator: "'They gave me this replacement though, so I put it up here.' ~ J"
  +endConversation()

